## Checklist Before Submitting PR:

- [ ] **Context7 docs pulled**: link to specific pattern used (section/heading from doc).
- [ ] **Template alignment**: button/modal/badge/table classes match active template.
- [ ] **Response structure**: all API responses match format above.
- [ ] **Security**: endpoints check `isHcmAdmin()`, return 403 if needed.
- [ ] **Frontend build**: `npm run build` succeeds.
- [ ] **Tests**: new endpoints have at least happy + forbidden scenario.
- [ ] **Script includes**: views use cache-bust `?v={{filemtime(...)}}`.
- [ ] **No hardcoded UI strings**: use camelCase field mapping from API.

