## Example: Correct Package CRUD Flow

### 1. Controller (Laravel 11 + Context7 pattern)
```php
public function store(Request $request): JsonResponse
{
    // Context7: "Laravel 11 authorization patterns"
    if (!$this->isHcmAdmin($request)) {
        return response()->json([
            'success' => false,
            'error' => ['code' => 'ADMIN_REQUIRED', 'message' => 'Admin only.'],
        ], 403);
    }
    
    // Validate per Context7 "validation best practices"
    $validated = $request->validate([
        'name' => 'required|string|max:100',
        'monthly_price' => 'required|numeric|min:0',
        'status' => 'sometimes|in:active,inactive,archived',
    ]);
    
    $package = Package::create($validated);
    return response()->json(['success' => true, 'data' => $package], 201);
}
```

